<!DOCTYPE html>
{#
    The document's one colour is the school's own — taken from Settings → General →
    brand colour, and darkened only as far as it takes to keep white text readable
    on it (BrandColor::onWhite, the same rule the public site follows). A school
    that has never set a colour gets the neutral slate band.
#}
{% set brand = school.primaryColor ? school.primaryColor|brand_on_white : '#1F2937' %}
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>{{ school.name ?? 'School' }} — Offer of Admission</title>
{#
    PRINT TEMPLATE. Modelled on the school's own Offer of Admission letter:

        crest + school name + motto        ·        Date
        addressee                                   Admission No
                        OFFER OF ADMISSION  (centred, underlined)
        "This is to inform you that … has offered you a provisional Admission into …
         for the 2026/2027 Academic session."
        "You are therefore required to proceed with the registration immediately …"
        "Find attached the breakdown of school fees, rules and regulations."
        "Accept our congratulations"
        Yours faithfully, signature, name, title          · QR verification
        ── contact banner ──

    Plain CSS and tables only — Dompdf renders this file, and the identical file
    is served for `?format=html`, so the screen proof cannot disagree with the paper
    (.github/skills/pdf-documents).
#}
<style>
    @page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 6mm 8mm 12mm 8mm; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; font-family: "DejaVu Serif", serif; font-size: 10.4pt; color: #111827; line-height: 1.5; }

    /* ── Letterhead ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .lh { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    .lh td { vertical-align: middle; padding: 0; }
    .lh-crest { width: 26mm; }
    .lh-crest img { max-width: 24mm; max-height: 24mm; }
    .lh-text { text-align: center; padding: 0 4mm; }
    .lh-name {
        margin: 0; font-family: "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 17pt; font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #111827; line-height: 1.15;
    }
    .lh-motto {
        margin: 2pt 0 0; font-family: "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 7.6pt;
        letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6B7280;
    }
    .lh-spacer { width: 26mm; }
    .rule { border: 0; border-top: 1.6pt solid {{ brand }}; margin: 4pt 0 0; }
    .rule-soft { border: 0; border-top: .5pt solid {{ brand }}; margin: 1.4pt 0 0; }

    /* ── Date, addressee, admission number ────────────────────────────── */
    .date { margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: right; font-size: 10pt; }
    .date-label { color: #4B5563; }

    .to { margin: 12pt 0 0; }
    .to-name { margin: 0; font-weight: bold; }
    .to-line { margin: 0; color: #4B5563; font-size: 9.4pt; }

    .adm { margin: 9pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; }
    .adm-label { font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: .04em; }
    .adm-value { font-family: "DejaVu Sans Mono", monospace; font-weight: bold; }

    /* ── Title ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .title {
        margin: 14pt 0 12pt; text-align: center;
        font-family: "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: underline;
    }

    p { margin: 0 0 8pt; text-align: justify; }
    .fill { font-weight: bold; }

    /* ── Signature + QR ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .sign { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 16pt; }
    .sign td { vertical-align: bottom; padding: 0; }
    .sign .who { width: 66%; }
    .sign .qr-cell { width: 34%; text-align: right; }
    .sig-img { max-height: 15mm; max-width: 48mm; margin-bottom: 1pt; }
    .sig-line { width: 62mm; border-bottom: .8pt solid #111827; height: 15pt; }
    .sig-name {
        margin: 4pt 0 0; font-family: "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;
        font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em;
    }
    .sig-role { margin: 0; font-size: 9.4pt; color: #111827; }
    .qr-box { text-align: center; display: inline-block; }
    .qr-box img { width: 27mm; height: 27mm; }
    .qr-caption { margin: 2pt 0 0; font-size: 6.4pt; line-height: 1.3; color: #6B7280; }
    .qr-code { font-family: "DejaVu Sans Mono", monospace; font-weight: bold; color: #111827; }

    /* ── Page footer ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
       `position: fixed` is the only way Dompdf puts something at the foot of a
       page and repeats it on every page — a fixed-height table only works while
       one page holds the content, and the rules appendix runs to two. The 12mm
       bottom page margin keeps running text clear of the band. */
    .page-footer { position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; }

    body { padding-bottom: 2mm; }

    .banner { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: {{ brand }}; }
    .banner td { padding: 5pt 8pt; color: #F9FAFB; font-family: "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 7.2pt; line-height: 1.45; }
    .banner .verify { text-align: right; color: #D1D5DB; }
    .banner .verify .code { font-family: "DejaVu Sans Mono", monospace; font-weight: bold; color: #FFFFFF; }

    /* ── Appendices ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
       Each appendix starts its own page: the letter is a letter, and a school
       files the fee breakdown and the rules behind it. */
    .appendix { page-break-before: always; padding-top: 2pt; }
    .appendix-kicker {
        margin: 0; font-family: "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 7.4pt; font-weight: bold;
        text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1pt; color: #6B7280;
    }
    .appendix-title {
        margin: 2pt 0 0; font-family: "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;
        color: #111827; padding-bottom: 3pt; border-bottom: 1.4pt solid #111827;
    }
    .appendix-lede { margin: 5pt 0 8pt; font-size: 9.4pt; color: #4B5563; }
    .appendix-body p { margin: 0 0 6pt; font-size: 9.8pt; text-align: justify; }
    .appendix-note {
        margin-top: 10pt; padding: 5pt 8pt; background: #F9FAFB; border-left: 2.4pt solid {{ brand }};
        font-size: 8pt; color: #4B5563;
    }

    /* Fee table: three weights of rule, no outlines around the whole thing. */
    table.fees { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 4pt; }
    table.fees th {
        background: #F3F4F6; border-top: .8pt solid #D1D5DB; border-bottom: .8pt solid #D1D5DB;
        padding: 3pt 5pt; font-family: "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 7.6pt;
        text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .3pt; text-align: left;
    }
    table.fees td { border-bottom: .5pt solid #E5E7EB; padding: 2.6pt 5pt; font-size: 9.4pt; }
    table.fees td.num, table.fees th.num { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
    table.fees tr.total td {
        border-top: .8pt solid #D1D5DB; border-bottom: 0; font-weight: bold;
        font-family: "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 9.6pt;
    }
    /* Part B of the school's fee matrix: one-off items a new pupil pays once. */
    table.fees tr.group td {
        background: #F3F4F6; border-bottom: 0; padding-top: 4pt; padding-bottom: 3pt;
        font-size: 7.6pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .4pt;
        color: #4B5563;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

    {# ── LETTERHEAD ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
    <table class="lh">
        <tr>
            <td class="lh-crest">{% if logo %}<img src="{{ logo }}" alt="">{% endif %}</td>
            <td class="lh-text">
                <p class="lh-name">{{ school ? school.displayName : 'School' }}</p>
                {% if school.motto %}<p class="lh-motto">{{ school.motto }}</p>{% endif %}
            </td>
            <td class="lh-spacer"></td>
        </tr>
    </table>
    <hr class="rule">
    <hr class="rule-soft">

    {# ── DATE ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
    <p class="date"><span class="date-label">Date:</span> {{ admitted_on|date('jS F, Y') }}</p>

    {# ── ADDRESSEE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
    <div class="to">
        {% if guardian %}
            <p class="to-name">{{ guardian.fullName }}</p>
            {% if guardian.phoneNumber %}<p class="to-line">{{ guardian.phoneNumber }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% else %}
            <p class="to-name">The Parent / Guardian</p>
            <p class="to-line">of {{ student.fullName }}</p>
        {% endif %}
    </div>

    {# ── ADMISSION NUMBER ─────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
    <p class="adm">
        <span class="adm-label">ADMISSION No:</span>
        <span class="adm-value">{{ reference }}</span>
    </p>

    {# ── TITLE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
    <p class="title">Offer of Admission</p>

    {# ── BODY ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
    <p>
        This is to inform you that <span class="fill">{{ school.name ?? 'the school' }}</span> has offered
        <span class="fill">{{ student.fullName|upper }}</span> a <span class="fill">provisional Admission</span>
        into <span class="fill">{{ placed_in ?: 'the class assigned by the school' }}</span>
        for the <span class="fill">{{ session_name ?: 'current' }}</span> Academic session{{ term_name ? ', commencing ' ~ term_name : '' }}.
    </p>

    <p>
        You are therefore required to proceed with the registration immediately at the school.
    </p>

    <p>
        Find attached the breakdown of school fees, rules and regulations.
    </p>

    <p>Accept our congratulations.</p>

    <p>Yours faithfully,</p>

    {# ── SIGNATURE + VERIFICATION QR ──────────────────────────────────── #}
    <table class="sign">
        <tr>
            <td class="who">
                {% if signature %}
                    <img class="sig-img" src="{{ signature }}" alt="">
                    <div style="width:62mm; border-bottom:.8pt solid #111827; height:3pt;"></div>
                {% else %}
                    <div class="sig-line"></div>
                {% endif %}
                <p class="sig-name">{{ school.principalName ?: 'The Principal' }}</p>
                <p class="sig-role">{{ school.principalTitle ?: 'Principal / Head Teacher' }}</p>
            </td>
            <td class="qr-cell">
                {% if verification %}
                    <div class="qr-box">
                        <img src="{{ verification.qr }}" alt="Verification QR code">
                        <p class="qr-caption">
                            Scan to verify this letter<br>
                            <span class="qr-code">{{ verification.code }}</span>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    {# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       APPENDIX A — the school fees breakdown for the class admitted into.
       "Find attached the breakdown of school fees" is a promise; this is it.
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #}
    {% if fees|length %}
        <div class="appendix">
            <p class="appendix-kicker">Appendix A</p>
            <h2 class="appendix-title">Breakdown of school fees</h2>
            <p class="appendix-lede">
                {{ fee_class ?: 'Admitted class' }}{% if fee_term %} · {{ fee_term }}{% endif %}{% if fee_session %} · {{ fee_session }} academic session{% endif %}
            </p>

            <table class="fees">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th style="width: 8%">S/N</th>
                        <th>Fee item</th>
                        <th class="num" style="width: 28%">Amount</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for fee in fees_recurring|default([]) %}
                        <tr>
                            <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
                            <td>{{ fee.name }}</td>
                            <td class="num">₦{{ fee.amount|number_format(2) }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {% endfor %}

                    {% if fees_new_intake|default([])|length %}
                        {# The school's own fee matrix calls this Part B — what only a
                           new pupil pays, once. Keeping it visibly separate is what
                           lets a parent compare the letter with the poster on the wall. #}
                        <tr class="group">
                            <td colspan="3">New intake — one-off</td>
                        </tr>
                        {% for fee in fees_new_intake %}
                            <tr>
                                <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
                                <td>{{ fee.name }}</td>
                                <td class="num">₦{{ fee.amount|number_format(2) }}</td>
                            </tr>
                        {% endfor %}
                    {% endif %}

                    <tr class="total">
                        <td colspan="2">Total payable</td>
                        <td class="num">₦{{ fee_total|number_format(2) }}</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>

            {% if fees_already_paid|default([])|length %}
                {# The form fee was paid with the application. Saying so keeps the
                   arithmetic on the page honest instead of silently dropping a line. #}
                <p class="appendix-note" style="margin-top: 3pt;">
                    The admission / application form fee
                    {% for fee in fees_already_paid %}
                        (₦{{ fee.amount|number_format(2) }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %})
                    {% endfor %}
                    has already been paid with your application and is <strong>not</strong> included above.
                </p>
            {% endif %}

            <p class="appendix-note">
                Fees may be paid in full or in part at the school's bursary, or online where the school
                offers it. A part payment does not clear the invoice; the balance remains payable for
                the term, and a receipt is issued for every payment received.
            </p>
        </div>
    {% endif %}

    {# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       APPENDIX B (and following) — the school's own documents: rules and
       regulations first. Same words as the school's website, one source.
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ #}
    {% for document in appendices %}
        <div class="appendix">
            <p class="appendix-kicker">Appendix {{ fees|length ? 'B' : 'A' }}{{ loop.index > 1 ? loop.index : '' }}</p>
            <h2 class="appendix-title">{{ document.title }}</h2>
            <div class="appendix-body">
                {% for paragraph in document.paragraphs %}
                    <p>{{ paragraph }}</p>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
            <p class="appendix-note">
                This document is also published on the school's website. Ask the school office for a
                printed copy if you need one.
            </p>
        </div>
    {% endfor %}

    {# ── PAGE FOOTER (repeats at the foot of every page) ──────────────── #}
    <div class="page-footer">
        <table class="banner">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 62%">
                    {{ school.address ?? '' }}{% if school.address %} ·{% endif %}
                    {% if school.phoneNumber %} TEL: {{ school.phoneNumber }}{% endif %}{% if school.email %}, Email: {{ school.email }}{% endif %}
                </td>
                <td class="verify" style="width: 38%">
                    {% if verification %}
                        Verify: <span class="code">{{ verification.url }}</span>
                    {% endif %}
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
